<section><h3>Mover launcher and event watcher</h3><p>Reviewed launcher protection: <strong><?=$fpEsc($fpLabel($fpReport['mover_gate']??'unknown'))?></strong></p><p>The package includes guarded Mover tools and a separate integration helper. Integration updates the reviewed User Scripts file with backup, preserving the schedule. This interface does not start Mover. Status verifies the read script only, not other launch paths.</p>
<p>Protection is never automatically overridden for low space. The global launcher defers for unfinished downloads; capacity warnings require action. This gate does not cover Mover started manually or through another schedule.</p>
