 <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$msEsc($msToken??'')?>"><input type="hidden" name="ms_csrf" value="<?=$msEsc($msToken)?>"><input type="hidden" name="source_hash" value="<?=hash('sha256',(string)$msSource)?>">
 <div class="grid">
 <div class="box"><h2>01 · Free-space threshold</h2><p>Below this amount of free cache space, the script attempts to start the built-in Mover.</p><label for="ms-threshold">Threshold (GiB)</label><br><input id="ms-threshold" name="KUSZOB_GIB" type="number" min="1" max="<?=$msMax?>" required value="<?=$msValues['KUSZOB_GIB']?>"><input id="ms-slider" aria-label="Free-space threshold slider" type="range" min="1" max="<?=$msMax?>" value="<?=$msValues['KUSZOB_GIB']?>"><small>Higher value: may start sooner. Lower value: files stay in cache longer.</small></div>
 <div class="box"><h2>02 · Retry interval</h2><p>Minimum time between two start attempts.</p><label for="ms-cooldown">Wait (minutes)</label><br><input id="ms-cooldown" name="UJRA_PROBALKOZAS_MP" type="number" min="1" max="10080" required value="<?=$msValues['UJRA_PROBALKOZAS_MP']?>"><p id="ms-hours"></p><small>The script check schedule separately determines when the next attempt occurs.</small></div>
 </div>
 <div class="box"><h2>Live settings preview</h2><p>Currently free: <strong><?= $msFree!==false?number_format($msFree/1073741824,1,'.',','):'—'?> GiB</strong> · Cache capacity: <?= $msTotal?number_format($msTotal/1073741824,1,'.',','):'—'?> GiB</p><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:<?=$msTotal&&$msFree!==false?100*(1-$msFree/$msTotal):0?>%"></div><div class="marker" id="ms-marker"></div></div><small>Fill: current usage · Vertical marker: configured start threshold</small><p class="preview" id="ms-preview"></p></div>
 <div class="box"><h2>Existing automation checks</h2><p>Your own script implements backup and parity guards; this settings page cannot verify them. Saving checks the Mover PID file.</p><p>Saving does not start Mover. The next script run uses the new values; a backup is created before each change.</p><button type="submit">Save settings</button><button type="reset" class="secondary">Reset changes</button><p><small>Change the schedule on the existing User Scripts page.</small></p></div>
 </form>
</div>
<script>
(()=>{const t=document.getElementById('ms-threshold'),s=document.getElementById('ms-slider'),c=document.getElementById('ms-cooldown'),free=<?=json_encode($msFree!==false?$msFree/1073741824:null)?>,total=<?=json_encode($msTotal?$msTotal/1073741824:null)?>;function preview(){document.getElementById('ms-hours').textContent=(Number(c.value)/60).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:2})+' hours';document.getElementById('ms-marker').style.left=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,100*(1-Number(t.value)/total)))+'%';document.getElementById('ms-preview').textContent=free===null?'Cache data is currently unavailable.':free<Number(t.value)?'Free space is already below the threshold. The next check decides whether to start based on guards and the retry interval.':'Another '+(free-Number(t.value)).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:1})+' GiB of free space can be used before reaching the threshold.';}t.addEventListener('input',()=>{s.value=t.value;preview()});s.addEventListener('input',()=>{t.value=s.value;preview()});c.addEventListener('input',preview);t.form.addEventListener('reset',()=>setTimeout(preview,0));preview();})();
</script>



